      "notes": {
        "public": "",
        "value": "<h2>Printed Statblock</h2><p><strong>Hit Dice:</strong> 1d8+3 (7 hp)</p><p><strong>Initiative:</strong> +1</p><p><strong>Speed:</strong> 20 ft. (4 squares), swim 40 ft.</p><p><strong>Armor Class:</strong> 15 (+5 natural), touch 10, flat-footed 15</p><p><strong>Base Attack/Grapple:</strong> +1/+5</p><p><strong>Attack:</strong> Claw +6 melee (1d6+4)</p><p><strong>Full Attack:</strong> 2 claws +6 melee (1d6+4)</p><p><strong>Space/Reach:</strong> 5 ft./5 ft.</p><p><strong>Special Attacks:</strong> Improved grab</p><p><strong>Special Qualities:</strong> Darkvision 60 ft., partially amphibious, resistance to cold 2, stability, unusual anatomy, makrura traits</p><p><strong>Saves:</strong> Fort +5, Ref +0, Will +1</p><p><strong>Abilities:</strong> Str 18, Agy 10, Sta 16, Int 8, Spt 13, Cha 6</p><p><strong>Skills:</strong> Balance +4, Listen +3, Spot +3, Swim +12</p><p><strong>Feats:</strong> Weapon Focus (claw)</p><p><strong>Area:</strong> Any</p><p><strong>Organization:</strong> Solitary, pair, patrol (3-7 plus 1 tidecaller), or colony (8-40 plus 1-6 tidecallers, 1-4 leaders of 6th-9th level, and noncombatants equal to 150% the number of combatants)</p><p><strong>Treasure:</strong> Standard</p><p><strong>Advancement:</strong> By character class</p><p><strong>Level Adjustment:</strong> Use racial levels</p><p><strong>Manual boundary:</strong> situational targeting, tactical decisions, and exceptional special abilities remain GM-adjudicated unless an embedded item provides a roll or effect.</p>"
      },
